      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2320,
       "endIndex": 2484,
       "text": "**Rationale:** Google frequently uses sign-on bonuses to bridge the transition and offset unvested equity or impending bonus payouts left behind at competitor firms"
