     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2624,
       "endIndex": 2801,
       "text": "**Rationale:** Mention that your long-term earnings trajectory and refresher stacking at Meta make you cautious about the Year 3/4 drop-off in Google's front-loaded equity model"
